    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "The main purpose of this study is to learn more about the safety and efficacy of investigational tirzepatide doses in participants with Type 2 diabetes and obesity that are already taking metformin. The study will last for about 89 weeks.",
      "detailedDescription": "The study will include a screening period of up to 5 weeks. The primary endpoint will be at Week 44 with a tirzepatide extension until week 80. A safety follow up will be performed approximately 4 weeks after end of treatment."
    },
